This package installs Vesktop, a custom Discord client with Vencord pre-installed.

Optional runtime dependencies:

  - libnotify: Native desktop notifications. Vesktop falls back to its own
               in-app notifications if missing.
  - xdg-utils: Allows Vesktop to hand off opening links and files to the
               their default applications via xdg-open.

Install them manually if you need them:

  # xbps-install -S libnotify xdg-utils